#: desc: SUB with L:0: the values start where the doc starts if it is empty, and the next ones (M:1) are under the first one
-v COLOR=0 -v 'SUB=<L:0,M:0>empty-flat:x y z;<L:0>empty-lines:x y z;<L:0,I:(,T:),S:\\,>initial:x y z;<L:0>two-lines:x y z;<L:0>backticks:x y z' test/fixtures/Makefile.sub-layout
#: stdout
------------------
Available targets:
------------------
empty-flat    x y z
empty-lines   x
              y
              z
initial       doc with I, T and S (x,
                                   y,
                                   z)
two-lines     a doc on
              two lines x
                        y
                        z
backticks     doc with `backticks` x
                                   y
                                   z
------------------
